# Force LF line endings for all text files in the working tree on every OS.
# Without this, Windows CI runners (core.autocrlf=true) check files out with
# CRLF and `prettier --check` — which expects LF — flags every file, failing
# the Windows leg of the CI matrix while Linux/macOS pass.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Binary assets git must never touch (no EOL conversion, no diff).
*.png  binary
*.jpg  binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif  binary
*.ico  binary
*.icns binary
*.woff  binary
*.woff2 binary
*.zip  binary
*.dmg  binary
*.exe  binary
